  "notes": "{乾|かわ}かす means to dry something by removing moisture.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pair: {乾|かわ}く (intransitive, to become dry)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {髪|かみ}を{乾|かわ}かす: to dry one's hair\n- {洗濯物|せんたくもの}を{乾|かわ}かす: to dry laundry\n- {手|て}を{乾|かわ}かす: to dry one's hands\n- ドライヤーで{乾|かわ}かす: to dry with a dryer\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {乾燥|かんそう}: dryness, dehydration\n- {乾燥機|かんそうき}: dryer (machine)\n- ドライヤー: hair dryer",
